abstract: "Code and saved evaluation records for a cross-dataset study of tuberculosis chest-radiograph classifiers built on frozen RAD-DINO and DINOv2 features. Classifiers were developed on Shenzhen and evaluated on Montgomery and a duplicate-screened TBX11K cohort. The archive covers threshold transfer, threshold-selection uncertainty, negative-case spectrum, calibration, matched encoder-resolution comparisons and a preprocessing diagnostic. Raw radiographs and model binaries are not included."
keywords:
  - tuberculosis
  - chest radiography
  - external validation
  - decision threshold
  - calibration
  - reproducibility
